an class=\"me2\">range_value_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> lazy_split_view<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/all_view\"><span class=\"kw2934\">views::<span class=\"me2\">all_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/single_view\"><span class=\"kw3122\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">single_view</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/range_size_t\"><span class=\"kw2912\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">range_value_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>These <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/class_template_argument_deduction\">deduction guides</a> are provided for <span class=\"t-lc\">lazy_split_view</span> to allow deduction from a range and a delimiter.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> The delimiter is a range of elements.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> The delimiter is a single element.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ranges&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string_view&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;type_traits&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">using</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">operator</span><span class=\"st0\">\"\"</span>sv<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</spa